            "review_title": "Review at Pizza Sen Ninh Binh",
            "review_text": "Ngoc D\nBuckingham, Canada21 contributions\n0\nNgoc\nOct 2026 • Couples\nIf you find yourself in the Ninh Binh Old Quarter, you have to check out Sen Pizza! We stopped by on October 21 and were immediately impressed by the great location and welcoming atmosphere. The pizza itself was top-notch—perfectly cooked and full of flavor.\nWhat really made our visit memorable, however, was the exceptional service. The whole team was wonderful, but we have to give a massive shoutout to Cuong. He was incredibly fast and attentive, but he truly went above and beyond when he took the time to go out and help us track down a bottle of mosquito repellent. It’s that kind of genuine care and hospitality that makes a restaurant stand out. Thank you, Cuong, and the rest of the Sen Pizza team for such a great experience!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 1, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
